4. Critical Access Rules
These are the most important rules for your system:

Only Platform Super Admin can create schools
Only School Super Admin can view full teacher details and full user details inside the school
Teachers cannot view other teachers’ profiles
Teachers can only view student status for assigned students/classes
Class Teachers can only view students assigned to their class
Accounts users can access fee data only
Parents can see only their own child’s records
Students can see only their own records
Only School Super Admin can manage roles, permissions, and staff assignments
Only School Super Admin can view full teacher performance reports
Teachers can view only their own timetable, own status, and own performance summary
Sensitive modules like audit logs, user management, and permissions must never be visible to teachers


5. Recommended Data Scope Rules
Platform Super Admin

all schools
all system configuration
optional read access to all tenant data

School Super Admin

all users, teachers, students, classes, fees, reports within that school

Teacher

only assigned classes
only assigned students
only own timetable/calendar
only own performance summary

Class Teacher

all assigned class students
attendance, marks, remarks, weak student alerts for assigned class

Accounts / Fee Manager

student fee records
fee structure
receipts
due/overdue reports
no teacher HR-style visibility

Parent

only own child
attendance, marks, fees, exam schedule, syllabus, holidays, notices

Student

only own profile, attendance, marks, exams, syllabus, fee status if allowed


